Source: sovrn-os
Section: system
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Sovrn OS Team <team@sovrn.os>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 13), cargo (>= 1.75), golang-go (>= 1.22), python3 (>= 3.12), npm (>= 10)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/sovrn-os/sovrn

Package: sovrn-os
Architecture: amd64
Depends: sovrnd, sovrn-dht, sovrn-identity, sovrn-presence, sovrn-feed, sovrn-message-queue, sovrn-cdn-agent, sovrn-auth, sovrn-monitor, sovrn-notify-bridge, sovrn-oobe, sovrn-hub, caddy, yggdrasil, nftables, unbound, libnotify-bin
Description: Sovrn OS - Privacy-first decentralized operating system
 Metapackage that installs all Sovrn OS components including the mesh
 services, web hub, OOBE wizard, and supporting infrastructure.

Package: sovrnd
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-fastapi, python3-uvicorn, python3-pydantic, python3-httpx, python3-nacl, python3-jwt
Description: Sovrn OS central orchestrator daemon
 FastAPI REST API daemon that proxies to mesh services via Unix sockets.
 Runs on port 54771 and provides the main API gateway.

Package: sovrn-dht
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.38)
Description: Sovrn DHT mesh service
 Distributed Hash Table service for .sovrn domain resolution
 and content discovery on the Yggdrasil mesh network.

Package: sovrn-identity
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.38)
Description: Sovrn identity service
 Key management, seed phrase derivation, and cryptographic identity
 service for the Sovrn mesh network.

Package: sovrn-presence
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.38), yggdrasil
Description: Sovrn presence service
 Heartbeat and peer tracking service that monitors which nodes
 are online on the Yggdrasil mesh network.

Package: sovrn-feed
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.38)
Description: Sovrn social feed service
 Content-addressed social feed service supporting posts, comments,
 reactions, and search on the Sovrn mesh.

Package: sovrn-message-queue
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.38), yggdrasil
Description: Sovrn encrypted messaging service
 End-to-end encrypted direct messaging service using X25519
 key exchange and AES-256-GCM encryption.

Package: sovrn-cdn-agent
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.38)
Description: Sovrn CDN agent
 Content delivery agent that pushes static assets to Sia/IPFS/Filecoin
 and serves them from edge cache for .sovrn domains.

Package: sovrn-auth
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-fastapi, python3-uvicorn, python3-pydantic
Description: Sovrn access policy engine
 Standalone policy engine that enforces role-based access control
 for Sovrn OS API endpoints.

Package: sovrn-monitor
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-fastapi, python3-uvicorn, python3-pydantic, python3-psutil
Description: Sovrn system monitoring service
 System health monitoring service tracking CPU, memory, disk,
 network, and service health metrics.

Package: sovrn-notify-bridge
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-fastapi, python3-uvicorn, python3-pydantic, python3-websockets, libnotify-bin
Description: Sovrn notification bridge service
 Bridges WebSocket events from sovrnd to desktop notifications
 via libnotify/org.freedesktop.Notifications.

Package: sovrn-oobe
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.38), libadwaita-1-0 (>= 1.5), libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.14)
Description: Sovrn OOBE (Out-of-Box Experience)
 GTK4/libadwaita first-boot wizard that guides users through
 identity creation, domain registration, and network setup.

Package: sovrn-hub
Architecture: all
Depends: nginx | caddy
Description: Sovrn Hub PWA (Progressive Web App)
 Pre-built Preact PWA providing the web interface for Sovrn OS.
 Served via Caddy on port 54772.
